Package: pressR
Title: Scrape Press Releases from U.S. Congress Members' Websites
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zayne", "Sember", , "zaynesember@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects press releases from United States Congress members'
    websites (House '.house.gov' and Senate '.senate.gov') over a date
    range. Detects the content-management system behind each site (Drupal,
    ASP.NET, WordPress, or a generic fallback) and routes to a dedicated
    extractor, fetching pages statically by default and falling back to a
    headless browser only where required.
